This tests CGO memory sharing, in-place mutation, and concurrency safety: Go -> C pointer passing, mutating Go memory in C, and correctness under parallel calls.

## Key Concepts
- CGO memory sharing
- Passing Go slices to C
- In-place mutation and memory safety
- Concurrency and goroutine safety
- Edge-case handling for n == 0

## Code Example
